at migsadia la ding pamuntuk da ring pamilya da ring tribu nang juda at benjamin ding pari at ding levita at ing metung at metung a tigkilan na pusu ning dios ban mibalik jerusalem at italakad deng pasibayu ing templo ning ginu karin jerusalem
